# UI/UX skill (product console)

This repo is the **signed-in OLED ops console** (Tamagui / Expo). Visual work must follow **ui-ux-pro-max** plus the persisted design system — never invent a parallel look or copy `~/website` marketing chrome.

## Canonical skill path (only this one)

| What | Path |
| --- | --- |
| Skill | `.agents/skills/ui-ux-pro-max/SKILL.md` |
| Search CLI | `.agents/skills/ui-ux-pro-max/scripts/search.py` |
| Master | `design-system/turbopanel/MASTER.md` |
| Page overrides | `design-system/turbopanel/pages/<page>.md` (wins over Master) |
| Tokens | `src/lib/theme.ts` |

Do **not** install or search a second copy under `.cursor/skills/ui-ux-pro-max/`. Do **not** add unrelated design toolkit packs under `.cursor/skills/` — they are not part of this repo’s skill footprint. Expo/platform skills live under `.agents/skills/` only (see `AGENTS.md` → Agent skills).

## When to use

**Before** new pages/routes, redesigns, chrome/components, charts, nav, motion, or UX/a11y reviews. Skip only for pure non-visual work (API/types/fetch with no layout change).

## Mandatory first steps

From the **ui repo root**:

1. Read `.agents/skills/ui-ux-pro-max/SKILL.md`
2. Search (prefer `python3`):

```bash
python3 .agents/skills/ui-ux-pro-max/scripts/search.py \
  "devops control plane dark dense dashboard" --design-system -p "TurboPanel"
python3 .agents/skills/ui-ux-pro-max/scripts/search.py "<query>" --domain style
python3 .agents/skills/ui-ux-pro-max/scripts/search.py "<query>" --stack react-native
```

3. Read `design-system/turbopanel/MASTER.md`, then `pages/<page>.md` if it exists
4. Reuse `org-panel-styles.ts` / neighboring org components; implement with `theme.ts` tokens only

Full contract: `AGENTS.md` → **Design system (ui-ux-pro-max)**. Do not `--persist --force` Master unless an explicit redesign was requested.
